  List DialecticalDepthBookkeeping
canonicalDialecticalDepthBookkeeping =
  priorSynthesisCarriedAsSubvoxelContent
  ∷ nextEncounterReadsPriorSynthesis
  ∷ repeatedEncounterIncreasesRecordedDepth
  ∷ []

